  "body": "Discover the perfect blend of opportunity and lifestyle with this expansive 712sqm (more or less) section in beautiful Campbells Bay. Tucked away in a private, gated community, this serviced section is more than just a blank canvas for your dream home - it includes a 1/5th share of 5735sqm (more or less) of pristine native bushland. Picture yourself exploring tranquil wooden boardwalks and streams, surrounded by lush greenery and serenity.\r\nThis prime location is only 400m walking distance from Campbells Bay Beach, offering a coastal lifestyle like no other. Zoned for a single dwelling with protective covenants, you can design and build with confidence, knowing the neighbourhood will maintain its high standards.\r\nThe benefits don't stop there. Enjoy the convenience of being close to the North Shore's best amenities while securing access to top-tier schools including Campbells Bay School, Mairangi Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Rangitoto College, and Westlake Boys & Girls High Schools.\r\nOur motivated vendor is ready to make a deal, so don't miss out on this rare chance to create the lifestyle you've always envisioned.\r\nAct now and bring your vision to life in Campbells Bay!",
